B6b. e_anti > 1/3 for all n = 8..101 (Kimi EC claim), monotonicity n=8..20
==============================================================================
  violations of e_anti > 1/3 in n=8..101: NONE
  min margin = 1/384 at n=8 (claim: 1/384 at n=8: True)
  strictly increasing on n=8..20: True
  values n=8..20:
    e_anti(8) = 43/128 = 0.335938
